  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="4.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAtr">III Atr</ref> 4.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And gif se ágena frígia nelle þæt ordal gesecean, gilde XX óran ⁊ sy his spæce forlóren; ⁊ he þeah gange þam landrícan to ordale oððe agife twygilde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">But if the owner [of the goods] shall fail to appear at the ordeal, he shall pay 20 ores and shall lose his case. But nevertheless the lord of the manor shall cause him (the thief) to go to the ordeal or pay double the value of the goods.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et si agenfria uenire nolit ad ordalium uidendum, reddat uiginti oras et perdat placitum suum; et ille tamen eat landesrico (id est terre domino) ad ordalium uel reddat duplum.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
